<p>My only disappointment is that my right eye looks perfectly normal. I was kind of hoping for something cool,
	like Geordi La Forge's bionic one.</p>

<img src="Geordi.jpg" />

<p>Nevertheless, I can't wait to have the left eye done! I just have to wait for the surgical center to call me
	to make an appointment.</p>

